2026-10-28T17:15:51.3407713Z {"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01EFkrAKDwzVCf1YiGtzLaKd","type":"tool_result","content":"{\n  \"issue\": {\n    \"number\": 7,\n    \"title\": \"[Enhancement]: Support public endpoints (connection_type) for aws_elasticache_serverless_cache\",\n    \"author_association\": \"NONE\",\n    \"labels_at_open\": [\n      \"enhancement\"\n    ]\n  },\n  \"as_of\": \"2026-10-13T17:13:31+00:00\",\n  \"form\": {\n    \"template\": \"Request an Enhancement\",\n    \"missing_required\": [],\n    \"empty_optional\": [],\n    \"used_form\": true\n  },\n  \"services\": {\n    \"resources_mentioned\": [\n      {\n        \"name\": \"aws_elasticache_serverless_cache\",\n        \"resource_exists\": true,\n        \"data_source_exists\": true,\n        \"service_label\": \"service/elasticache\"\n      }\n    ],\n    \"regex_labeler_would_apply\": [\n      \"service/elasticache\"\n    ],\n    \"primary_service_label\": \"service/elasticache\"\n  },\n  \"versions\": {\n    \"terraform\": null,\n    \"provider\": null,\n    \"latest_release\": \"6.68.0\",\n    \"latest_release_date\": \"2026-10-07\",\n    \"provider_status\": \"not_reported\",\n    \"newer_release_notes\": [],\n    \"newer_fixes\": []\n  },\n  \"similar_issues\": [\n    {\n      \"number\": 48371,\n      \"ref\": \"hashicorp/terraform-provider-aws#48371\",\n      \"title\": \"network_type argument for Elasticache serverless cache\",\n      \"body_excerpt\": \"The Elasticache Serverless Cache has an option for allowing users to chose either ipv4, ipv6 or dualstack network type. This is currently not available in the [aws_elasticache_serverless_cache]( resource. - [Choosing a network type for serverless caches]( - [CreateServerlessCache]( * aws_elasticache_serverless_cache hcl resource \\\"aws_elasticache_serverless_cache\\\" \\\"example\\\" { engine = \\\"valkey\\\" name\",\n      \"state\": \"closed\",\n      \"state_reason\": \"completed\",\n      \"